 you need to have  sovereign wealth funds and national  pension funds representatives of the  long term collective interest using  their considerable financial power to  back long-term oriented corporate  behavior above all mergers and  acquisitions need to be made more  difficult as its the threat of these  that typically pushes managers towards  actions that please fickle short-term  investors all these schemes may seem  like pipe dreams but they're far more  tantalizing than this there are real  possibilities alive in certain favored  enlightened corners of the globe right  now there's no need to give up on  capitalism we just need to understand it  a little better and stand up to  arguments that bully us into accepting  its worst versions  you
 

